From e30a194b08e01bc55a8d093924ddfcdedf08b644 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Subrata Chatterjee <schatterjee@habana.ai>
Date: Sun, 25 Jul 2021 07:30:05 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-45031] gaudi2: remove duplicate code

Target is to avoid duplicate code across different
gaudi2 targets(i.e. arm and arc). In this
patch many functions common in gaudi2/arm/common.c
and gaudi2/arc/common.c moved to gaudi2/common/common.c.

Change-Id: Ib3fd215b48261a963225af55cf1807a22162e7a5
Signed-off-by: Subrata Chatterjee <schatterjee@habana.ai>
---

diff --git a/arch/gaudi2/arc/common.c b/arch/gaudi2/arc/common.c
index b773690..66c72bc 100644
